    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43478" root="&#xA;                        مأن&#xA;                    " body-key="m1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَأَنَهُمْ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He sustained them; bore the burden
of,</i> or <i>undertook, their maintenance; he maintained them.</i> (S, K, arts. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مأن</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مون</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَأَنَ القَوْمَ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَأَّنَهُمْ</span></b> 
                        <i>He maintained,</i> or <i>sustained, the people,</i> or <i>party.</i> (M.)

